**Key pattern:** The vehicle source is injected; the model owns state machine logic (loading, error, retry, auto-refresh on stale). The host supplies `onSelect` callback that routes changes back (equivalent of web `setVehicleId`). Vehicles list comes from KMP-core's repository layer via `Shared.VehicleHolder`.

